# Check out text files with LF line endings on every OS. Windows would otherwise get CRLF, and the golden
# files (tests/*/*.out, *.err), the programs and docs the tests read, and the sh launcher bin/alang must
# stay byte for byte as committed.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Except the Windows launcher: cmd.exe misreads a batch file with LF line endings.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
